                    \\,,
            %p
              where on the right we have the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eilenberg-MacLane+space"} Eilenberg-MacLane space
              from Def.
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#EilenbergMacLaneSpaces"}
          %p
            The following is an immediate re-casting of the traditional definition of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+cohomology"} group cohomology
          %p
