            %h6 Proof
            %p
              This follows by unwinding the component formula for the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/evaluation+map"} evaluation map
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+mapping+complexes"} simplicial mapping complexes
              (
              %a{:href => "function+complex#ComponentFormulaForEvaluationMap"}> this Prop.
              ):
            %p Recall that we denote by
            #eq:CellInNerveOfInertiaGroupoid.maruku-equation
